### State persistence (ANVIL-ERA, no longer active)

`anvil-rope.service` (now retired) persisted state to `/opt/datachain-rope/anvil-state/state.json`.
A backup cron ran every 4 hours. **Reth replaces this entirely** — Reth uses
a crash-safe MDBX + RocksDB datadir at `/opt/datachain-rope/reth/data/`, and
state is replicated every 6 hours to the IPFS three-node mesh
(per `reth-blue-green-ipfs-architecture.mdc`).

